{%- comment -%}
  Payment methods row, one source for every surface: Bundle & Save, cart drawer, footer, quantity-breaker,
  bundle-builder and reactive-variant-selector. Shopify's own full-colour icons.

  Rule: a curated list per region of the methods people there use, in this order, and each icon only when
  shop.enabled_payment_types contains its type. That list follows the visitor's market, so the row never shows
  a method the checkout doesn't offer. Compared by payment TYPE, not by icon: iDEAL | Wero is type "ideal",
  its svg id is "pi-spidealwero".
  - US, and every country not listed below: visa, master, american_express, discover, paypal, apple_pay,
    google_pay, shopify_pay, venmo, afterpay, klarna
  - GB: visa, master, american_express, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay, shopify_pay, klarna, maestro
  - CA: visa, master, american_express, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay, shopify_pay, interac
  - AU, NZ: visa, master, american_express, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay, shopify_pay, afterpay
  - EU countries of the store (AT, BE, IE, NL, HU): visa, master, american_express, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay,
    shopify_pay, klarna, plus ideal (NL), bancontact (BE), eps (AT)
  - PL: blik, visa, master, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay, shopify_pay
  - SG: visa, master, american_express, paypal, apple_pay, google_pay, shopify_pay
  Enabled types measured 06.11.2026: US and GB = achdirectdebit, american_express, apple_pay, bancontact,
  diners_club, discover, google_pay, master, paypal, shopify_pay, visa; the other markets = amazon_pay,
  american_express, apple_pay, bancontact, diners_club, discover, google_pay, master, shopify_pay, visa.
  So today US shows Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Discover, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Shop Pay; the rest of the
  list appears by itself once the method is switched on in Settings > Payments.

  Styles: .mgx-pay-icons in magyx-brand.css (one row, wraps on narrow screens). Surfaces with their own look pass
  their classes instead.

  Accepts (all optional):
  - class {String} list class (default 'mgx-pay-icons')
  - item_class {String} class on each <li>
  - icon_class {String} class on each icon (default 'mgx-pay-icons__icon')
  - label {String} list aria-label (default: premium.pdp.payment_methods)

  Usage:
  {% render 'mgx-payment-icons' %}
  {% render 'mgx-payment-icons', class: 'list list-payment', item_class: 'list-payment__item', icon_class: 'icon icon--full-color' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case localization.country.iso_code
    when 'GB'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,klarna,maestro'
    when 'CA'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,interac'
    when 'AU', 'NZ'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,afterpay'
    when 'NL'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,klarna,ideal'
    when 'BE'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,klarna,bancontact'
    when 'AT'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,klarna,eps'
    when 'IE', 'HU'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,klarna'
    when 'PL'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'blik,visa,master,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay'
    when 'SG'
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay'
    else
      assign mgx_pay_list = 'visa,master,american_express,discover,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,venmo,afterpay,klarna'
  endcase

  assign mgx_pay_shown = ''
  assign mgx_pay_wanted = mgx_pay_list | split: ','
  for mgx_pay_type in mgx_pay_wanted
    if shop.enabled_payment_types contains mgx_pay_type
      assign mgx_pay_shown = mgx_pay_shown | append: mgx_pay_type | append: ','
    endif
  endfor
  assign mgx_pay_shown = mgx_pay_shown | split: ','

  assign mgx_pay_class = class | default: 'mgx-pay-icons'
  assign mgx_pay_icon_class = icon_class | default: 'mgx-pay-icons__icon'
  assign mgx_pay_label = 'premium.pdp.payment_methods' | t
  if label != blank
    assign mgx_pay_label = label
  endif
-%}
{%- if mgx_pay_shown.size > 0 -%}
  <ul class="{{ mgx_pay_class }}" role="list" aria-label="{{ mgx_pay_label | escape }}">
    {%- for mgx_pay_type in mgx_pay_shown -%}
      <li{% if item_class != blank %} class="{{ item_class }}"{% endif %}>{{ mgx_pay_type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: mgx_pay_icon_class }}</li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
{%- endif -%}
